---
---

<section class="services-section section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal-on-scroll">
      <div class="section-tag">Ecosistema Digital y Servicios</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Herramientas en vivo para el monitoreo, gestión y operación en DMR
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Ponemos a disposición de la comunidad aplicaciones interconectadas que potencian la experiencia del radioaficionado moderno dentro y fuera del aire.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial Horizontal Bands -->
    <div class="services-list reveal-on-scroll">
      <!-- Service 1: Petra -->
      <div class="service-strip petra-featured">
        <div class="service-badge badge-community">
          <span>Desarrollo Comunitario Venezolano</span>
        </div>

        <div class="service-main-grid">
          <div class="service-narrative">
            <h3 class="service-heading">Petra · Estadísticas y Salud del TG 734</h3>
            <p class="service-desc">
              Plataforma informativa y de telemetría desarrollada por <strong>YY3BIG</strong> para BrandMeister Venezuela. Transmite al TG 734 reportes meteorológicos, alertas sísmicas y balizas horarias en telegrafía, además de monitorear en tiempo real la ocupación, salud y estaciones al aire.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-action-box">
            <a
              href="/petra"
              class="btn btn-primary"
            >
              <span>Conoce a Petra</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 2: Hoseline -->
      <div class="service-strip">
        <div class="service-badge badge-platform">
          <span>Herramientas de la plataforma</span>
        </div>

        <div class="service-main-grid">
          <div class="service-narrative">
            <h3 class="service-heading">BrandMeister Hoseline · Streaming de Audio</h3>
            <p class="service-desc">
              Escucha en tiempo real la modulación de cualquier Talkgroup mundial desde tu navegador web o teléfono móvil sin necesidad de tener un radio DMR encendido. Ideal para monitorizar el TG 734 mientras estás en tu estación de trabajo o en movimiento.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-action-box">
            <a
              href="http://hose.brandmeister.network/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn btn-primary"
            >
              <span>Sintonizar Hoseline</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Service 3: SelfCare & APRS -->
      <div class="service-strip">
        <div class="service-badge badge-platform">
          <span>Herramientas de la plataforma</span>
        </div>

        <div class="service-main-grid">
          <div class="service-narrative">
            <h3 class="service-heading">BrandMeister SelfCare & APRS Digital</h3>
            <p class="service-desc">
              Panel de autogestión de usuario para definir tu contraseña de seguridad (Hotspot Security Password), personalizar la marca de tu radio (Motorola, Anytone, Hytera) y configurar el envío de balizas APRS mediante DMR con tu propio icono e indicativo.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="service-action-box">
            <a
              href="https://brandmeister.network/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn btn-primary"
            >
              <span>Panel BrandMeister</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95) 48%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.60) 75%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.20) 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90) 10%, transparent 28%),
      linear-gradient(0deg, #FFFFFF 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90) 10%, transparent 28%),
      url('/assets/services-bm-dashboard.webp');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: right center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .services-section {
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92) 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65) 80%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35) 100%),
        url('/assets/services-bm-dashboard.webp');
      background-position: center top;
      background-size: cover;
    }
  }

  .services-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .service-strip {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.25rem);
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    transition: all 0.25s ease;
  }

  .service-strip:hover {
    border-color: rgba(238, 108, 31, 0.35);
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .service-strip.petra-featured {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
  }

  .service-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--bm-red);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232, 38, 28, 0.45);
    background: rgba(232, 38, 28, 0.04);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .service-main-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .service-main-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
  }

  .service-heading {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .service-desc {
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .service-action-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-width: 210px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .service-action-box {
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
  }

  .service-action-box .btn {
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
